{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260620","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260620","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826061001:":{"text":"윽... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","source_cn":"呃……<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3E5086DC22D325","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"윽... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","female":"윽... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","variant_male_record_index":"250850","variant_female_record_index":"250851","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826061002:":{"text":"긴장하지 마십시오. 최대한 빨리 회복할 수 있도록 돕는 중입니다.","source_cn":"别紧张，<male>他</male><female>她</female>会帮你尽快恢复","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x065781C9268BB3B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"긴장하지 마십시오. 최대한 빨리 회복할 수 있도록 돕는 중입니다.","female":"긴장하지 마십시오. 최대한 빨리 회복할 수 있도록 돕는 중입니다.","variant_male_record_index":"250852","variant_female_record_index":"250853","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826061003:":{"text":"여기는... 지하 묘실?!","source_cn":"这……这里是地宫？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EB9B62EDF632F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826062001:1":{"text":"테페시아...","source_cn":"苔佩希……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74256CC0C4F85EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826062002:1":{"text":"역시... 깨워버렸군요... <style=\"highlight\">아버님</style>...","source_cn":"果然……吵醒您了……<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106B2B95BFA591BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1826062002":{"text":"역시... 깨워버렸군요... <style=\"highlight\">아버님</style>...","source_cn":"果然……吵醒您了……<style=highlight>父亲大人</style>……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106B2B95BFA591BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826062004:1":{"text":"테페시아, 네 임기가 아직 끝나지 않았거늘 어째서 미리 잠든 것이지? 게다가 외부인 둘까지 지하 묘실에 들이다니?","source_cn":"苔佩希，你的任期尚未结束，为何提前沉睡？还将两个外人引...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D7B9C90F638026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826062005:1":{"text":"콜록, 콜록... 아버님. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(은)는 죽음의 신을 여러 차례 뵌 적이 있으니... 외부인이라고 할 수는 없답니다.","source_cn":"咳、咳……父亲大人，<style=stress><pl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEF991A8BDB1E669B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"콜록, 콜록... 아버님. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(은)는 죽음의 신을 여러 차례 뵌 적이 있으니... 외부인이라고 할 수는 없답니다.","female":"콜록, 콜록... 아버님. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(은)는 죽음의 신을 여러 차례 뵌 적이 있으니... 외부인이라고 할 수는 없답니다.","variant_male_record_index":"250859","variant_female_record_index":"250860","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826062006:1":{"text":"그리고 일찍 잠든 이유는... 제가 관에 누워 있는데도 아직 눈치채지 못하신 건가요?","source_cn":"至于提前沉睡的原因……余都已躺入棺材，难道您还未察觉吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7F231C598EC952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826062007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 도움이 없었더라면 저는 분명 아버님보다 먼저 죽음의 신의 품으로 돌아갔을 테지요...","source_cn":"若非<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA00555F52AD6942B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 도움이 없었더라면 저는 분명 아버님보다 먼저 죽음의 신의 품으로 돌아갔을 테지요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 도움이 없었더라면 저는 분명 아버님보다 먼저 죽음의 신의 품으로 돌아갔을 테지요...","variant_male_record_index":"250862","variant_female_record_index":"250863","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826062008:1":{"text":"차라리 눈치채지 못했으면 좋았을 것을. 그래야 너처럼 나태한 녀석 때문에 잠에서 깨지 않았을 테니까!","source_cn":"吾倒是希望吾觉察不到，免得被你这游手好闲的贵族大小姐吵醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA13C584A618CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826062009:1":{"text":"됐다. 뭐라 해봐야 듣지도 않겠지... 어서 회복해서 <style=\"highlight\">성 밖에 몰려든 반티스 벌레들을 쓸어버려라</style>.","source_cn":"算了，指责你你也不会听……你还是快些恢复，去<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985CF4085F43BC60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1826062009":{"text":"됐다. 뭐라 해봐야 듣지도 않겠지... 어서 회복해서 <style=\"highlight\">성 밖에 몰려든 반티스 벌레들을 쓸어버려라</style>.","source_cn":"算了，指责你你也不会听……你还是快些恢复，去<style=highlight>清理聚在城外的班题斯虫豸</style>吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985CF4085F43BC60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826062010:1":{"text":"그놈들이 이 일을 꾸민 건 하루 이틀이 아니다.","source_cn":"他们这份预谋可不是一日两日了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E619100165A3977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826062012:1":{"text":"놈들이 내 잠을 방해하게 두지 말고 어서 처리해라! 여기서도 놈들이 풍기는 비린내가 느껴지는구나!","source_cn":"赶快处理掉，别让他们打搅吾的清静梦！吾在这里都能闻到他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C4EFA5FB23A71DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1826062013:1":{"text":"한편, 노바리스에서는...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D07EB8BC0591C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"반티스 군대가 벌써 성 밖에 와 있다고?","source_cn":"班题斯军队已经在城外了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65ABC6C1F9CEDB99","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"반티스 군대가 벌써 성 밖에 와 있다고?","female":"반티스 군대가 벌써 성 밖에 와 있다고?","variant_male_record_index":"94815","variant_female_record_index":"94816","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice: